    BMR056: {"name":"Nick the Masher","flavor":"The young cleric was well-armed, and brave enough to take on the Dragon King himself. His credo: \"I bash it with my mace.\""},
    BMR057: {"name":"Pugi the Druidess","flavor":"A defender of the wilderness, she wields the power of Nature. Flowers blossom in her footsteps, and life grows anew."},
    BMR058: {"name":"Acacia, Warrior of Light","flavor":"Acacia is a carefree soul who makes her own luck. A strong defender of good, she is undeterred by even the darkest dungeons."},
    BMR059: {"name":"Charles the Young","flavor":"Charles has mother's permission to go adventuring, but he has to return before sundown."},
    BMR060: {"name":"Delatorious, Angel of Light","flavor":"Created by the Goddess of Light to defend Arcadia, this kid angel never misses a shot with his enchanted crossbow."},
    BMR061: {"name":"Romero, the Indigo Friar","flavor":"He is a dedicated man of the cloth who wants to see the world coated in blue. You might think he's depressed, but he's actually very, very happy."},
    BMR062: {"name":"Boden the Pantless","flavor":"Boden's courage is matched only by his forgetfulness. The quest to find his misplaced armor continues!"},
    BMR063: {"name":"Jarek, Squire to the Lion Knights","flavor":"As a squire, Jarek loved nothing more than stories and legends. He had no idea that someday, he would become one."},
    BMR064: {"name":"Fire's Breath, Heroine of Arcadia","flavor":"The scarlet-haired warrior woman known as Fire's Breath has pledged her deadly twin blades to the fight for liberty"},
    BMR065: {"name":"Samurai Tom","flavor":"Not truly a samurai, this masterless ronin seeks honor and glory."},
    BMR066: {"name":"Johnny of the Evening Watch","flavor":"A humble member of the Evening Watch, whose band o'brothers is sworn to forsake family, take the grey, and clear dungeons."},
    BMR067: {"name":"Crystol and A'lan of Gerd","flavor":"Bound by the unbreakable Ring of Gerd, these lovers became the most dangerous husband-wife team in the adventuring business."},
    BMR068: {"name":"Tieg and the Magic Bubble","flavor":"Armed with his trusty bubble, Tieg braves dangerous castles and dungeons in search of the musical instruments stolen from his people."},
    BMR069: {"name":"Brandork the Neverwrong","flavor":"Schooled in seven flavors of magic, Brandork follows the teachings of master Face, the Omniscient Celestial"},
    BMR070: {"name":"Mitchell, the Judge","flavor":"He has wandered the planes, hopelessly lost... ever since his wife, Nikki, sent him to the store for diamond dust sugar."},
    BMR071: {"name":"Kalish Ninefingers","flavor":"The worst thief ever, Kalish lost a finger and his freedom in one night. Taught magic in prison by his sorcerous cellmate, he now kills evil with fire."},
    BMR072: {"name":"Dartteon, Elf Pyromancer","flavor":"Some elves just want to watch the world burn."},
    BMR073: {"name":"Koey, The Last Dragon Mage","flavor":"The survivor of Drakonia vowed to save the world from Kirax's reign with the power bestowed to him by the last emerald dragon."},
    BMR074: {"name":"Joman Chimm, Cutpurse","flavor":"From the twinkle in his eye, you might think he comes bearing gifts... until you check your empty pockets."},
    BMR075: {"name":"Lance Uppercut, Treasure Hunter","flavor":"With a bent blade and a clenched fist, he gathers shining treasures for the glory of the Keonish Empire."},
    BMR076: {"name":"Jesta the Rogue","flavor":"\"Okay, so you take the big guy on the left with the axe, you've got the two little ones on the right with swords, and I'll take this dangerous-looking treasure chest with no lock over here...\""},
    BMR077: {"name":"Kins Klauski, Mad Conquistador","flavor":"\"It's hard for me to think about death, how insects and worms will eat me... I never think about death. I haven't even properly started to live yet.\""},
    BMR078: {"name":"Sir Digby Apple, Ace Detective","flavor":"He battles to keep the coffers filling, to keep his partners preening and to send a needless message of power to all of the unwilling."},
    BMR079: {"name":"Jerome, Kung Fu Monkey","flavor":"A Visitor from a distant land, his hyperactive monkey studied martial arts under the legendar Sifu Wang."},
    BMR080: {"name":"The Fool","text":"The Fool is lured to the dungeon of the Boss Monster with the fewest Souls. (In the case of a tie, he waits in town until the tie is broken.)"},
    BMR081: {"name":"Katelyn, Angelic Healer","flavor":"Among the most exalted defenders of righteousness, Katelyn is sometimes referred to as \"altissima luce\" -- highest light."},
    BMR082: {"name":"Kerberos Dirtbeard, Canine Cleric","flavor":"Hailing from the Highlands, this flea-bitten friar never turns down a fetch quest."},
    BMR083: {"name":"Lord Van Ette","flavor":"A prophet and collector of tithes for the omniscient Celestial, his \"miracles\" are enhanced by the brandewijn distilled by the monks of Nintehn."},
    BMR084: {"name":"Jejune & Everlea, Holy Sisters","flavor":"Tenacious and vivacious, each is a threat on her own. But woe betide any who stand against the sisters' united power."},
    BMR085: {"name":"Frankov, the Envoy","flavor":"This brave warrior stands alone against the evil that rules the world."},
    BMR086: {"name":"Nate the Squidslayer","flavor":"This surly warrior defeated the mighty Squib, Lord of the Rocktopi. Now he seeks to destroy King Croak himself..."},
    BMR087: {"name":"Antonius, the Rune Knight","flavor":"An elite dragoon, Sir Tony wears armor inscribed with magic runes of ancient and mysterious power."},
    BMR088: {"name":"Asmor the Aweless","flavor":"What Asmor lacks in tactical acuity, he more than makes up for in impulsiveness. There's no door he won't kick down, much to the frustration of Arcadia's innkeepers."},
    BMR089: {"name":"Tempros the Time Marauder","flavor":"He would use his control over time to end all crime. In his hands, this world could be a utopia."},
    BMR090: {"name":"Chia Kang, Mystical Warlock of Yu","flavor":"\"Hey, Listen! I think this Boss Monster is--\" \"Silence, fairy! I will crush him through fire and flames in the name of the Order!"},
    BMR091: {"name":"Terric Warhelm, Half-Elf Archmage","flavor":"\"Weakened by an evil curse, this once-mighty warrior donned the red robes and turned to magic. His spells are chnneled through a magical helmet of untold power.\""},
    BMR092: {"name":"Wayward, the Drifter","flavor":"He is a traveler from a strange land whose only goal is to do whatever is right... whatever that means."},
    BMR093: {"name":"Hya, Legendary Shinobi","flavor":"Arcadia's deadliest ninja,Hya lives by the proverb that revenge is a dish best served cold."},
    BMR094: {"name":"Blackbeard Jake","flavor":"He hid the treasure he won from insult swordfighting in a booty-trap filled cave on the coast of a town called Astoria."},
    BMR095: {"name":"Cecil Leoran, Master Factotum","flavor":"The ultimate jack-of-all-trades, Cecil isn't above taking mercenary work to earn gold and glory. But his real goal has never changed: to find a way to return his betrothed Nevra, sealed into a rapier, to her original form."},
    BMR096: {"name":"Wallbanger Basketweaver","flavor":"This humble halfing world rather spend his days weaving baskets and eating crumbly cookies. But when adventure calls, he proves a first-rate burglar"},
